  "sourceUrl": "https://static.us.zyxel.com/pdf/2024/switch/ds_GS1900-10HP.pdf",
  "notes": "Zyxel GS1900 Series datasheet (dated 16/11/22) https://static.us.zyxel.com/pdf/2024/switch/ds_GS1900-10HP.pdf; specification table https://www.zyxel.com/global/en/products/switch/gs1900-series/specification. Management and switching features from the datasheet feature list and the GS1900 Series User Guide V2.90 Edition 2 https://download.zyxel.com/GS1900-48HPv2/user_guide/GS1900-48HPv2_V2.90_Ed2.pdf. There is NO console port and no CLI anywhere in the series: management is the web GUI, SNMP v1/v2/v3, RMON 1/2/3/9, syslog, LLDP/LLDP-MED, 802.1x, RADIUS and TACACS+, which is why no device here declares cli. Twenty-four-port model with uplinks: total port count 26 = 24 RJ45 + 2 SFP, no PoE, 17.1 W maximum consumption, 440 x 131 x 44 mm, 2.09 kg, fanless. The datasheet ordering table lists GS1900-24-EU0102F / -US0102F at hardware revision B1."
